flowchart LR
 Browser[🌐 Browser] --> Web[Laravel web routes]
 Web --> MW[Session / auth / verified middleware]
 MW --> Controller[Controllers + Form Requests]
 Controller --> Models[Eloquent models]
 Models --> DB[(Configured database)]
 Controller --> Inertia[Inertia response]
 Inertia --> Vue[Vue 3 pages and components]
 Vue --> Vite[Vite-built assets]
 Controller --> FS[Public filesystem disk for current post images]
